{"kind": "prepare", "evidence": [{"id": "zy-2-judgment", "hexagramId": 2, "name": "坤", "section": "judgment", "line": null, "text": "元亨，利牝马之贞。君子有攸往，先迷，后得主，利。西南得朋，东北丧朋。安贞吉。", "source": "https://github.com/john-walks-slow/open-iching/blob/4c5f00f8cb62c6e0d2471243d28150b473ef592f/iching/iching.json", "locator": "坤·卦辞", "version": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62-v2", "review": "版本已固定，结构已验证；文字未完成逐条人工校勘", "layer": "classic", "workId": "zhouyi", "workTitle": "周易", "sourceId": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62", "editionId": "open-iching-v2", "editionLabel": "Open I Ching 固定快照（未逐条校勘）", "authorIds": [], "authorNames": [], "anchorIds": ["zhouyi:02:judgment"], "commentsOn": [], "reviewStatus": "legacy_unreviewed", "releaseId": "knowledge-v3-20260926-r1", "textOriginal": "元亨，利牝马之贞。君子有攸往，先迷，后得主，利。西南得朋，东北丧朋。安贞吉。"}, {"id": "zy-2-tuan", "hexagramId": 2, "name": "坤", "section": "tuan", "line": null, "text": "至哉坤元，万物资生，乃顺承天。坤厚载物，德合无疆；含弘光大，品物咸亨。“牝马”地类，行地无疆。柔顺利贞，君子攸行。先迷失道，后顺得常。“西南得朋”，乃与类行；“东北丧朋”，乃终有庆。安贞之吉，应地无疆。", "source": "https://github.com/john-walks-slow/open-iching/blob/4c5f00f8cb62c6e0d2471243d28150b473ef592f/ichuan/tuan.json", "locator": "坤·彖传", "version": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62-v2", "review": "版本已固定，结构已验证；文字未完成逐条人工校勘", "layer": "classic", "workId": "zhouyi", "workTitle": "周易", "sourceId": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62", "editionId": "open-iching-v2", "editionLabel": "Open I Ching 固定快照（未逐条校勘）", "authorIds": [], "authorNames": [], "anchorIds": ["zhouyi:02:tuan"], "commentsOn": [], "reviewStatus": "legacy_unreviewed", "releaseId": "knowledge-v3-20260926-r1", "textOriginal": "至哉坤元，万物资生，乃顺承天。坤厚载物，德合无疆；含弘光大，品物咸亨。“牝马”地类，行地无疆。柔顺利贞，君子攸行。先迷失道，后顺得常。“西南得朋”，乃与类行；“东北丧朋”，乃终有庆。安贞之吉，应地无疆。"}, {"id": "zy-2-xiang", "hexagramId": 2, "name": "坤", "section": "xiang", "line": null, "text": "地势坤，君子以厚德载物。", "source": "https://github.com/john-walks-slow/open-iching/blob/4c5f00f8cb62c6e0d2471243d28150b473ef592f/ichuan/xiang.json", "locator": "坤·大象", "version": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62-v2", "review": "版本已固定，结构已验证；文字未完成逐条人工校勘", "layer": "classic", "workId": "zhouyi", "workTitle": "周易", "sourceId": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62", "editionId": "open-iching-v2", "editionLabel": "Open I Ching 固定快照（未逐条校勘）", "authorIds": [], "authorNames": [], "anchorIds": ["zhouyi:02:xiang"], "commentsOn": [], "reviewStatus": "legacy_unreviewed", "releaseId": "knowledge-v3-20260926-r1", "textOriginal": "地势坤，君子以厚德载物。"}, {"id": "zy-2-line-1", "hexagramId": 2, "name": "坤", "section": "line", "line": 1, "text": "履霜，坚冰至。", "source": "https://github.com/john-walks-slow/open-iching/blob/4c5f00f8cb62c6e0d2471243d28150b473ef592f/iching/iching.json", "locator": "坤·初六", "version": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62-v2", "review": "版本已固定，结构已验证；文字未完成逐条人工校勘", "layer": "classic", "workId": "zhouyi", "workTitle": "周易", "sourceId": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62", "editionId": "open-iching-v2", "editionLabel": "Open I Ching 固定快照（未逐条校勘）", "authorIds": [], "authorNames": [], "anchorIds": ["zhouyi:02:line:1"], "commentsOn": [], "reviewStatus": "legacy_unreviewed", "releaseId": "knowledge-v3-20260926-r1", "textOriginal": "履霜，坚冰至。"}, {"id": "zy-2-line-2", "hexagramId": 2, "name": "坤", "section": "line", "line": 2, "text": "直方大，不习无不利。", "source": "https://github.com/john-walks-slow/open-iching/blob/4c5f00f8cb62c6e0d2471243d28150b473ef592f/iching/iching.json", "locator": "坤·六二", "version": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62-v2", "review": "版本已固定，结构已验证；文字未完成逐条人工校勘", "layer": "classic", "workId": "zhouyi", "workTitle": "周易", "sourceId": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62", "editionId": "open-iching-v2", "editionLabel": "Open I Ching 固定快照（未逐条校勘）", "authorIds": [], "authorNames": [], "anchorIds": ["zhouyi:02:line:2"], "commentsOn": [], "reviewStatus": "legacy_unreviewed", "releaseId": "knowledge-v3-20260926-r1", "textOriginal": "直方大，不习无不利。"}, {"id": "zy-2-line-3", "hexagramId": 2, "name": "坤", "section": "line", "line": 3, "text": "含章可贞；或从王事，无成有终。", "source": "https://github.com/john-walks-slow/open-iching/blob/4c5f00f8cb62c6e0d2471243d28150b473ef592f/iching/iching.json", "locator": "坤·六三", "version": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62-v2", "review": "版本已固定，结构已验证；文字未完成逐条人工校勘", "layer": "classic", "workId": "zhouyi", "workTitle": "周易", "sourceId": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62", "editionId": "open-iching-v2", "editionLabel": "Open I Ching 固定快照（未逐条校勘）", "authorIds": [], "authorNames": [], "anchorIds": ["zhouyi:02:line:3"], "commentsOn": [], "reviewStatus": "legacy_unreviewed", "releaseId": "knowledge-v3-20260926-r1", "textOriginal": "含章可贞；或从王事，无成有终。"}, {"id": "zy-2-line-4", "hexagramId": 2, "name": "坤", "section": "line", "line": 4, "text": "括囊，无咎无誉。", "source": "https://github.com/john-walks-slow/open-iching/blob/4c5f00f8cb62c6e0d2471243d28150b473ef592f/iching/iching.json", "locator": "坤·六四", "version": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62-v2", "review": "版本已固定，结构已验证；文字未完成逐条人工校勘", "layer": "classic", "workId": "zhouyi", "workTitle": "周易", "sourceId": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62", "editionId": "open-iching-v2", "editionLabel": "Open I Ching 固定快照（未逐条校勘）", "authorIds": [], "authorNames": [], "anchorIds": ["zhouyi:02:line:4"], "commentsOn": [], "reviewStatus": "legacy_unreviewed", "releaseId": "knowledge-v3-20260926-r1", "textOriginal": "括囊，无咎无誉。"}, {"id": "zy-2-line-5", "hexagramId": 2, "name": "坤", "section": "line", "line": 5, "text": "黄裳，元吉。", "source": "https://github.com/john-walks-slow/open-iching/blob/4c5f00f8cb62c6e0d2471243d28150b473ef592f/iching/iching.json", "locator": "坤·六五", "version": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62-v2", "review": "版本已固定，结构已验证；文字未完成逐条人工校勘", "layer": "classic", "workId": "zhouyi", "workTitle": "周易", "sourceId": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62", "editionId": "open-iching-v2", "editionLabel": "Open I Ching 固定快照（未逐条校勘）", "authorIds": [], "authorNames": [], "anchorIds": ["zhouyi:02:line:5"], "commentsOn": [], "reviewStatus": "legacy_unreviewed", "releaseId": "knowledge-v3-20260926-r1", "textOriginal": "黄裳，元吉。"}, {"id": "zy-2-line-6", "hexagramId": 2, "name": "坤", "section": "line", "line": 6, "text": "龙战于野，其血玄黄。", "source": "https://github.com/john-walks-slow/open-iching/blob/4c5f00f8cb62c6e0d2471243d28150b473ef592f/iching/iching.json", "locator": "坤·上六", "version": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62-v2", "review": "版本已固定，结构已验证；文字未完成逐条人工校勘", "layer": "classic", "workId": "zhouyi", "workTitle": "周易", "sourceId": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62", "editionId": "open-iching-v2", "editionLabel": "Open I Ching 固定快照（未逐条校勘）", "authorIds": [], "authorNames": [], "anchorIds": ["zhouyi:02:line:6"], "commentsOn": [], "reviewStatus": "legacy_unreviewed", "releaseId": "knowledge-v3-20260926-r1", "textOriginal": "龙战于野，其血玄黄。"}, {"id": "zy-2-line_xiang-1", "hexagramId": 2, "name": "坤", "section": "line_xiang", "line": 1, "text": "“履霜坚冰”，阴始凝也；驯致其道，至坚冰也。", "source": "https://github.com/john-walks-slow/open-iching/blob/4c5f00f8cb62c6e0d2471243d28150b473ef592f/ichuan/xiang.json", "locator": "坤·初六小象", "version": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62-v2", "review": "版本已固定，结构已验证；文字未完成逐条人工校勘", "layer": "classic", "workId": "zhouyi", "workTitle": "周易", "sourceId": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62", "editionId": "open-iching-v2", "editionLabel": "Open I Ching 固定快照（未逐条校勘）", "authorIds": [], "authorNames": [], "anchorIds": ["zhouyi:02:line_xiang:1"], "commentsOn": [], "reviewStatus": "legacy_unreviewed", "releaseId": "knowledge-v3-20260926-r1", "textOriginal": "“履霜坚冰”，阴始凝也；驯致其道，至坚冰也。"}, {"id": "zy-2-line_xiang-2", "hexagramId": 2, "name": "坤", "section": "line_xiang", "line": 2, "text": "六二之动，“直”以“方”也。“不习无不利”，地道光也。", "source": "https://github.com/john-walks-slow/open-iching/blob/4c5f00f8cb62c6e0d2471243d28150b473ef592f/ichuan/xiang.json", "locator": "坤·六二小象", "version": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62-v2", "review": "版本已固定，结构已验证；文字未完成逐条人工校勘", "layer": "classic", "workId": "zhouyi", "workTitle": "周易", "sourceId": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62", "editionId": "open-iching-v2", "editionLabel": "Open I Ching 固定快照（未逐条校勘）", "authorIds": [], "authorNames": [], "anchorIds": ["zhouyi:02:line_xiang:2"], "commentsOn": [], "reviewStatus": "legacy_unreviewed", "releaseId": "knowledge-v3-20260926-r1", "textOriginal": "六二之动，“直”以“方”也。“不习无不利”，地道光也。"}, {"id": "zy-2-line_xiang-3", "hexagramId": 2, "name": "坤", "section": "line_xiang", "line": 3, "text": "“含章可贞”，以时发也；“或从王事”，知光大也。", "source": "https://github.com/john-walks-slow/open-iching/blob/4c5f00f8cb62c6e0d2471243d28150b473ef592f/ichuan/xiang.json", "locator": "坤·六三小象", "version": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62-v2", "review": "版本已固定，结构已验证；文字未完成逐条人工校勘", "layer": "classic", "workId": "zhouyi", "workTitle": "周易", "sourceId": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62", "editionId": "open-iching-v2", "editionLabel": "Open I Ching 固定快照（未逐条校勘）", "authorIds": [], "authorNames": [], "anchorIds": ["zhouyi:02:line_xiang:3"], "commentsOn": [], "reviewStatus": "legacy_unreviewed", "releaseId": "knowledge-v3-20260926-r1", "textOriginal": "“含章可贞”，以时发也；“或从王事”，知光大也。"}, {"id": "zy-2-line_xiang-4", "hexagramId": 2, "name": "坤", "section": "line_xiang", "line": 4, "text": "“括囊无咎”，慎不害也。", "source": "https://github.com/john-walks-slow/open-iching/blob/4c5f00f8cb62c6e0d2471243d28150b473ef592f/ichuan/xiang.json", "locator": "坤·六四小象", "version": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62-v2", "review": "版本已固定，结构已验证；文字未完成逐条人工校勘", "layer": "classic", "workId": "zhouyi", "workTitle": "周易", "sourceId": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62", "editionId": "open-iching-v2", "editionLabel": "Open I Ching 固定快照（未逐条校勘）", "authorIds": [], "authorNames": [], "anchorIds": ["zhouyi:02:line_xiang:4"], "commentsOn": [], "reviewStatus": "legacy_unreviewed", "releaseId": "knowledge-v3-20260926-r1", "textOriginal": "“括囊无咎”，慎不害也。"}, {"id": "zy-2-line_xiang-5", "hexagramId": 2, "name": "坤", "section": "line_xiang", "line": 5, "text": "“黄裳元吉”，文在中也。", "source": "https://github.com/john-walks-slow/open-iching/blob/4c5f00f8cb62c6e0d2471243d28150b473ef592f/ichuan/xiang.json", "locator": "坤·六五小象", "version": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62-v2", "review": "版本已固定，结构已验证；文字未完成逐条人工校勘", "layer": "classic", "workId": "zhouyi", "workTitle": "周易", "sourceId": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62", "editionId": "open-iching-v2", "editionLabel": "Open I Ching 固定快照（未逐条校勘）", "authorIds": [], "authorNames": [], "anchorIds": ["zhouyi:02:line_xiang:5"], "commentsOn": [], "reviewStatus": "legacy_unreviewed", "releaseId": "knowledge-v3-20260926-r1", "textOriginal": "“黄裳元吉”，文在中也。"}, {"id": "zy-2-line_xiang-6", "hexagramId": 2, "name": "坤", "section": "line_xiang", "line": 6, "text": "“龙战于野”，其道穷也。", "source": "https://github.com/john-walks-slow/open-iching/blob/4c5f00f8cb62c6e0d2471243d28150b473ef592f/ichuan/xiang.json", "locator": "坤·上六小象", "version": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62-v2", "review": "版本已固定，结构已验证；文字未完成逐条人工校勘", "layer": "classic", "workId": "zhouyi", "workTitle": "周易", "sourceId": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62", "editionId": "open-iching-v2", "editionLabel": "Open I Ching 固定快照（未逐条校勘）", "authorIds": [], "authorNames": [], "anchorIds": ["zhouyi:02:line_xiang:6"], "commentsOn": [], "reviewStatus": "legacy_unreviewed", "releaseId": "knowledge-v3-20260926-r1", "textOriginal": "“龙战于野”，其道穷也。"}, {"id": "zy-1-judgment", "hexagramId": 1, "name": "乾", "section": "judgment", "line": null, "text": "元亨利贞。", "source": "https://github.com/john-walks-slow/open-iching/blob/4c5f00f8cb62c6e0d2471243d28150b473ef592f/iching/iching.json", "locator": "乾·卦辞", "version": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62-v2", "review": "版本已固定，结构已验证；文字未完成逐条人工校勘", "layer": "classic", "workId": "zhouyi", "workTitle": "周易", "sourceId": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62", "editionId": "open-iching-v2", "editionLabel": "Open I Ching 固定快照（未逐条校勘）", "authorIds": [], "authorNames": [], "anchorIds": ["zhouyi:01:judgment"], "commentsOn": [], "reviewStatus": "legacy_unreviewed", "releaseId": "knowledge-v3-20260926-r1", "textOriginal": "元亨利贞。"}, {"id": "zy-1-xiang", "hexagramId": 1, "name": "乾", "section": "xiang", "line": null, "text": "天行健，君子以自强不息。", "source": "https://github.com/john-walks-slow/open-iching/blob/4c5f00f8cb62c6e0d2471243d28150b473ef592f/ichuan/xiang.json", "locator": "乾·大象", "version": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62-v2", "review": "版本已固定，结构已验证；文字未完成逐条人工校勘", "layer": "classic", "workId": "zhouyi", "workTitle": "周易", "sourceId": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62", "editionId": "open-iching-v2", "editionLabel": "Open I Ching 固定快照（未逐条校勘）", "authorIds": [], "authorNames": [], "anchorIds": ["zhouyi:01:xiang"], "commentsOn": [], "reviewStatus": "legacy_unreviewed", "releaseId": "knowledge-v3-20260926-r1", "textOriginal": "天行健，君子以自强不息。"}, {"id": "wang-bi@2404938:h2:line1:34a0a6e3df", "hexagramId": 2, "name": "坤", "section": "line", "line": 1, "text": "始於履霜，至於堅冰，所謂至柔而動也剛。陰之為道，本於卑弱而後積著者也，故取「履霜」以明其始。陽之為物，非基於始以至於著者也，故以出處明之，則以初為潛。", "textOriginal": "始於履霜，至於堅冰，所謂至柔而動也剛。陰之為道，本於卑弱而後積著者也，故取「履霜」以明其始。陽之為物，非基於始以至於著者也，故以出處明之，則以初為潛。", "source": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%91%A8%E6%98%93%E6%AD%A3%E7%BE%A9/01%E5%9D%A4&oldid=2404938", "locator": "《周易正義》·坤·第1爻注", "version": "ws-2404938", "review": "机器规则提取，已保留来源与边界；未经人工校勘，异文未擅改", "reviewStatus": "machine_parsed", "layer": "commentary", "workId": "zhouyi-zhengyi", "workTitle": "周易正義", "sourceId": "ws-2404938", "editionId": "ws-zhouyi-zhengyi", "editionLabel": "维基文库通行电子文本（底本未逐页核验）", "authorIds": ["wang-bi"], "authorNames": ["王弼"], "anchorIds": ["zhouyi:02:line:1"], "commentsOn": ["zhouyi:02:line:1"], "releaseId": "knowledge-v3-20260926-r1", "rawLocator": {"file": "data/knowledge/raw/ws-2404938.wiki", "startLine": 37, "endLine": 37, "pageLabels": []}}, {"id": "cheng-yi@1313743:h2:line1:cba77b823f", "hexagramId": 2, "name": "坤", "section": "line", "line": 1, "text": "陰爻稱六，陰之盛也。八則陽生矣，非純盛也。陰始生於下，至微也。聖人於陰之始生，以其將長，則為之戒。陰之始凝而為霜，履霜則當知陰漸盛而至堅冰矣。猶小人始雖甚微，不可使長，長則至於盛也。", "textOriginal": "陰爻稱六，陰之盛也。八則陽生矣，非純盛也。陰始生於下，至微也。聖人於陰之始生，以其將長，則為之戒。陰之始凝而為霜，履霜則當知陰漸盛而至堅冰矣。猶小人始雖甚微，不可使長，長則至於盛也。", "source": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E4%BC%8A%E5%B7%9D%E6%98%93%E5%82%B3&oldid=1313743", "locator": "《伊川易傳》·坤·第1爻注", "version": "ws-1313743", "review": "机器规则提取，已保留来源与边界；未经人工校勘，异文未擅改", "reviewStatus": "machine_parsed", "layer": "commentary", "workId": "yichuan-yizhuan", "workTitle": "伊川易傳", "sourceId": "ws-1313743", "editionId": "ws-yichuan-yizhuan", "editionLabel": "维基文库通行电子文本（底本未逐页核验）", "authorIds": ["cheng-yi"], "authorNames": ["程颐"], "anchorIds": ["zhouyi:02:line:1"], "commentsOn": ["zhouyi:02:line:1"], "releaseId": "knowledge-v3-20260926-r1", "rawLocator": {"file": "data/knowledge/raw/ws-1313743.wiki", "startLine": 233, "endLine": 233, "pageLabels": []}}, {"id": "zhu-xi@528287:h2:line1:aaed7e54b7", "hexagramId": 2, "name": "坤", "section": "line", "line": 1, "text": "六隂爻之名隂數六老而八少故謂隂爻為六也霜隂氣所結盛則水凍而為冰此爻隂始生於下其端甚微而其勢必盛故其象如履霜則知堅冰之將至也夫陰陽者造化之本不能相无而消長有常亦非人所能損益也然陽主生隂主殺則其𩔖有淑慝之分焉故聖人作易於其不能相无者既以健順仁義之屬明之而无所偏主至其消長之際淑慝之分則未嘗不致其扶陽抑隂之意焉蓋所以贊化育而參天地者其㫖深矣不言其占者謹微之意已可見於象中矣", "textOriginal": "六隂爻之名隂數六老而八少故謂隂爻為六也霜隂氣所結盛則水凍而為冰此爻隂始生於下其端甚微而其勢必盛故其象如履霜則知堅冰之將至也夫陰陽者造化之本不能相无而消長有常亦非人所能損益也然陽主生隂主殺則其𩔖有淑慝之分焉故聖人作易於其不能相无者既以健順仁義之屬明之而无所偏主至其消長之際淑慝之分則未嘗不致其扶陽抑隂之意焉蓋所以贊化育而參天地者其㫖深矣不言其占者謹微之意已可見於象中矣", "source": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%91%A8%E6%98%93%E6%9C%AC%E7%BE%A9%20%28%E5%9B%9B%E5%BA%AB%E5%85%A8%E6%9B%B8%E6%9C%AC%29/%E5%8D%B71&oldid=528287", "locator": "《周易本義》·坤·第1爻注", "version": "ws-528287", "review": "机器规则提取，已保留来源与边界；未经人工校勘，异文未擅改", "reviewStatus": "machine_parsed", "layer": "commentary", "workId": "zhouyi-benyi", "workTitle": "周易本義", "sourceId": "ws-528287", "editionId": "ws-benyi-skqs", "editionLabel": "维基文库四库全书本（未逐页对照影像）", "authorIds": ["zhu-xi"], "authorNames": ["朱熹"], "anchorIds": ["zhouyi:02:line:1"], "commentsOn": ["zhouyi:02:line:1"], "releaseId": "knowledge-v3-20260926-r1", "rawLocator": {"file": "data/knowledge/raw/ws-528287.wiki", "startLine": 13, "endLine": 13, "pageLabels": []}}], "scopeIds": [1, 2], "targets": [{"hexagramId": 2, "section": "special", "line": 7, "layer": "classic"}], "requireCitations": true, "nextStep": "route", "intent": "source_request", "durationMs": 36, "eventId": 1, "timestamp": "2026-10-10T11:35:31.957126+00:00", "caseId": "dev-33", "variant": "C"}
